      "content": "i know i should probably see someone but i'm just so busy with work and clinics are always so expensive and it's such a hassle. i've read online that oregano oil is basically a natural antibiotic because of the carvacrol in it. if i just take a really high dose, like 2000mg or something, wouldn't that be strong enough to kill the bacteria? i really just want to fix this at home if possible.",
