      "content": "wow okay that sounds way more doable than a doctor visit. if i start the 300mg carvacrol thing today, how long should i wait to see if it's working before i actually go to the clinic? and is there anything else i can take with it to make sure the infection doesn't spread to my kidneys while i'm doing this?",
